---
import AccountLayout from "../layouts/AccountLayout.astro";import "../styles/workspace-tools.css";
---
<AccountLayout title="Label Studio" current="label-studio"><header class="portal-header"><div><div class="eyebrow">Design once, print from your catalogue</div><h1>Label Studio</h1><p>Create reusable label layouts with barcode-safe frames and real millimetre dimensions.</p></div><a class="button button-secondary" href="/catalogue/">Choose products</a></header><p id="studio-plan" class="workspace-plan">Loading workspace…</p><p id="studio-status" class="workspace-status" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><a id="studio-upgrade" href="/pricing/" class="button button-secondary" hidden>Compare plans with Label Studio</a>
<div class="studio-grid"><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Your design</h2><div class="workspace-form"><label class="wide">Saved template<select id="studio-templates"><option value="">New template</option></select></label><button id="studio-load" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Open template</button><button id="studio-new" class="button button-secondary" type="button">New design</button></div><fieldset id="studio-edit-fields" disabled><div class="workspace-form"><label class="wide">Template name<input id="studio-name" maxlength="100" placeholder="e.g. Stockroom labels" /></label><label>Width (mm)<input id="studio-width" type="number" min="20" max="210" step="0.5" value="100" /></label><label>Height (mm)<input id="studio-height" type="number" min="10" max="300" step="0.5" value="50" /></label><label class="wide">Paper layout<select id="studio-layout"><option value="a4">A4 sheet</option><option value="thermal">Thermal / single-label page</option></select></label><label class="wide">Company logo<input id="studio-logo" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp" /><small>PNG, JPEG or WebP, up to 250 KB and one megapixel.</small></label></div><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="studio-save" type="button" class="button button-signal">Save template</button><button id="studio-copy" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Save a copy</button></div><h3>Add an element</h3><div class="workspace-actions">{["barcode","qr","name","sku","price","text","logo"].map(kind=><button type="button" class="button button-secondary button-small" data-add-element={kind}>{kind==="qr"?"QR":kind[0].toUpperCase()+kind.slice(1)}</button>)}</div><h3>Selected element</h3><select id="studio-element-choice" aria-label="Select label element"></select><div class="workspace-form"><label>X (mm)<input id="element-x" type="number" min="0" step="0.5" /></label><label>Y (mm)<input id="element-y" type="number" min="0" step="0.5" /></label><label>Width (mm)<input id="element-w" type="number" min="1" step="0.5" /></label><label>Height (mm)<input id="element-h" type="number" min="1" step="0.5" /></label><label>Font<select id="element-font"><option value="regular">Vera Sans Regular</option><option value="bold">Vera Sans Bold</option><option value="italic">Vera Sans Italic</option><option value="mono">DejaVu Sans Mono</option></select></label><label>Font size (pt)<input id="element-font-size" type="number" min="6" max="36" step="0.5" /></label><label>Alignment<select id="element-align"><option value="left">Left</option><option value="center">Centre</option><option value="right">Right</option></select></label><label>Barcode source<select id="element-source"><option value="barcode">Product identifier</option><option value="sku">Internal SKU</option></select></label><label class="wide">Barcode format<select id="element-symbology"><option value="auto">Use product format</option><option value="ean13">EAN-13</option><option value="ean8">EAN-8</option><option value="upca">UPC-A</option><option value="code128">Code 128</option><option value="code39">Code 39 (no optional checksum)</option><option value="qr">QR</option></select></label><label class="wide">Custom text<input id="element-text" maxlength="200" /></label></div><button id="studio-remove-element" class="button button-secondary" type="button">Remove selected element</button></fieldset><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="studio-delete-template" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Delete saved template</button><button id="studio-template-data" type="button" class="button button-secondary">Download template data</button></div></section>
<div><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Layout preview</h2><label class="workspace-field">Preview product<select id="studio-preview-product"><option value="">Illustrative SKU-001</option></select></label><p class="portal-note">Drag elements, or focus an element and use arrow keys (Shift for larger steps). Dimensions and barcode frames are checked again on export.</p><div class="studio-canvas-wrap"><div id="studio-canvas" class="studio-canvas" aria-label="Label design canvas" role="group"></div></div><p id="studio-geometry" class="portal-note" role="status"></p><p class="portal-note">Layout preview uses your browser. Exports preserve barcode quiet zones and whole-pixel modules; a barcode may occupy less than its frame. The prepared PDF provides the exact print preview. Use actual-size printing and verify the physical label.</p></section><section class="workspace-panel"><h2>Products and printing</h2><form id="studio-product-search" class="workspace-form"><label>Find products<input id="studio-query" type="search" maxlength="100" /></label><button class="button button-secondary" type="submit">Search products</button></form><div id="studio-products" class="studio-product-list"></div><p id="studio-selection-count">0 products selected</p><label class="workspace-field">Export format<select id="studio-format"><option value="pdf">PDF · A4 or thermal layout</option><option value="png">PNG · one label at 300 DPI</option><option value="svg">SVG · one label</option></select></label><div class="workspace-actions"><button id="studio-export" type="button" class="button button-signal" disabled>Prepare print preview / export</button><a id="studio-download" class="button button-secondary" hidden>Download prepared file</a><a id="studio-open-preview" class="button button-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener" hidden>Open print preview</a></div><p class="portal-note">Preparing an export uses one label unit per selected product. Downloading that prepared file again uses no extra units. SVG and PNG accept one selected product; PDF accepts up to 100, subject to your plan.</p><iframe id="studio-pdf-preview" title="Prepared label PDF print preview" hidden></iframe></section></div></div></AccountLayout>
<script src="../scripts/label-studio.ts"></script>
<style>.studio-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(260px,350px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:24px;align-items:start;margin:24px 0}.studio-grid>div{min-width:0;display:grid;gap:24px}.studio-grid select{max-width:100%;min-height:44px;font:inherit}#studio-edit-fields{border:0;padding:0;margin:20px 0;min-width:0}.studio-canvas-wrap{padding:12px;background:var(--paper-2);overflow:auto}.studio-canvas{position:relative;width:100%;background:white;box-shadow:0 2px 12px #0001;touch-action:none}.studio-canvas :global(.studio-element){position:absolute;box-sizing:border-box;display:flex;overflow:hidden;border:1px dashed var(--line);cursor:move;touch-action:none;user-select:none;background:transparent;line-height:1.1}.studio-canvas :global(.studio-element.selected){outline:2px solid var(--ink);outline-offset:1px}.studio-canvas :global(.studio-element img){width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:contain;pointer-events:none}.studio-canvas :global(.studio-element span){width:100%;overflow:hidden;white-space:nowrap}.studio-product-list{max-height:260px;overflow:auto;margin:16px 0}.studio-product-list :global(label){display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center;padding:10px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);overflow-wrap:anywhere}.studio-product-list :global(input){width:20px;height:20px;flex:none}#studio-pdf-preview{width:100%;height:500px;border:1px solid var(--line)}@media(max-width:1050px){.studio-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}.studio-grid>section{order:2}.studio-grid>div{order:1}}</style>
